      "id": "claim_b84ca73fa9ca440eaddd035980a5842f",
      "statement": "A thread’s durable sandbox binding is `sandbox_id` in thread metadata, while `SANDBOX_BACKENDS` is a worker-local map of stable per-thread proxies; metadata lookup prefers inline run metadata and otherwise reads the live thread, with lookup failures propagating rather than being treated as an unbound thread.",
